# Stream layer map for the UCI/INRF IGZO TFT process (igzo_mmm_lab).
#
# Four masks plus alignment, listed in process order (bottom of the stack
# first).  The 50 nm Al2O3 gate dielectric is a blanket ALD film and has no
# mask of its own; only its openings are drawn, on oxetch.
#
# oxetch does double duty: an opening with gate metal over it is a via between
# the two metals, and an opening with nothing over it is a probe window.
#
# name     purposes                  layer datatype
igzo       drawing                     4     0
sd         drawing                     6     0
sd         PIN,NET,SPNET               6    10
sd         LABEL                       6    20
oxetch     drawing                     5     0
gate       drawing                     2     0
gate       PIN,NET,SPNET               2    10
gate       LABEL                       2    20
align      drawing                     8     0
# not a mask: the value a parametric cell prints on itself
text       drawing                    63     0
